sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Angular frontend
  participant API as ASP.NET Core API
  participant Auth as Authentication services
  participant DB as SQL Server
  User->>UI: Submit credentials
  UI->>API: Login request
  API->>Auth: Validate credentials
  Auth->>DB: Read user and refresh token data
  Auth-->>API: Access token and refresh token
  API-->>UI: Return tokens
  UI->>API: Authenticated API request
  UI->>API: Refresh request when access token expires
  API->>Auth: Validate and rotate refresh token
  Auth->>DB: Persist rotated token
  API-->>UI: Return refreshed tokens
